					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10443466#post-4409025</guid>
				<title>[insert Twitter joke here]</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10443466/scp-1927-ex#post-4409025</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2019 22:54:19 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>GeekJokes_GJ</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5185474</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Yeah, i could say something or other about how &quot;the internet is bad&quot;, then counter that with some &quot;shut up boomer&quot; and &quot;you were just as shit as we are&quot; - something that &quot;both sides do&quot; (another fucking fallacy), pretending that as an argument.</p> <p>But this is more than that. It's the assessment that, throughout the centuries, we are still the same, we are afraid, and we crave that fear. It's why we're here, isn't it?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
